yes   : change abund ***************************DUST & ABUNDANCES
inputs/ABUND
no    : no more changes
no    : no offsets
yes   : include dust
yes   : change depletions
inputs/DEPLFILE
no    : no more changes
no    : allow grain destruction
M     : MRN distribution
yes   : Include PAH molecules?
0.3   : fraction of Carbon Dust Depletion in PAHs
Q     : PAH switch on QHDH < Value
4e2   : PAH switch on Value
no    : graphite grains to be cospatial with PAHs
no    : Evaluate dust temperatures and IR flux?
P7    : Photo. Abs. distance step, full cont ***************************START P7
D     : Default ionisation values
J     : Jin et al 2012 library v2
1     : mass 1=1e6,2=2e6,3=3e6,4=4e6,5=5e6,6=1e7,7=2e7,8=3e7,9=5e7,10=1e8,11=2e8,12=3e8,13=5e8,14=1e9
AGNLEDD     : Ledd Value 0.01 - 1.00
AGNTYPE     : N narrow or B broad then components thermal intermediate and non-thermal fractions
FDISK
FINTER
FCORONA
X     : eXit with current source
s     : spherical sided p=pp s =sph
L     : Source by Luminosity
T     : Total or Ionising Luminosity
44    : bolometric source luminosity (log erg/s)
B     : isoBaric, (const pressure)
A     : plain isobaric
LPKVALUE :  Pressure regime (p/k, <10 as log)
4     : log(Initial temperature)
1     : filling factor (0<f<=1)
U     : Give initial U(H)
LUVALUE  :  U(H)  [not Q(N)] at inner radius (< 100 as log)
y       : spherical integration
E     : Equilibrium ionization balance.
0.02  : Step value of the photon absorption fraction  *******
A     : Ionisation bounded, 99% neutral **********
A     : Standard output (photnxxxx,phapnxxxx)  >Name for run>>>>
